  "ai.orion81Builds": "Orion-81 yakavakirwa pasoftware yakavhurika yakanyorwa nevanhu. Inoratidzwa pano nokuti haina kuitwa neAI.",
  "ai.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 purojekiti yakagadzirwa yose neAI.<\/0> Mutsetse wose wekodhi yeOrion-81 pachayo wakanyorwa naClaude Code, ichitungamirirwa nemuvambi. Chikepe chose, mepu, mufananidzo wepamusoro nenzwi rimwe nerimwe zvakagadzirwa nezvishandiso zvakanyorwa naClaude Code. Muvambi anosarudza zvekuvaka; Claude Code inowana nzira yekuzviita. Raibhurari dzakavhurika dzainovakirwa dzinoratidzwa pazasi pe'Hazvina kuitwa neAI'. Chinhu chimwe chichiri chakavhurika uye chinoratidzwa pachena: <1>ongororo yerezinesi<\/1> yekodhi yemutambo yakabva kumuenzaniso wekutanga weGPL.",
  "ai.orionBegan28": "Orion yakatanga musi wa28 Gunyana 2026 semuenzaniso wekutanga paenjini yakavhurika yeQuake III Arena (GPL), ichitorera zvikepe zveElite Dangerous senhungamiro. Pazuva rechipiri kodhi yemutambo yakatamira paBuB, injini itsva yakanyorwa naClaude Code; zvikamu zvemutambo zvakabva pamuenzaniso wekutanga zvikapiwa mazita matsva. Vhezheni 0.3.0 yakapa mhando dzose 16 dzezvikepe miviri yadzo mitsva. Ongororo yekutevedzera mitemo yerezinesi iri kutarisa kuti pane kodhi yachiri kubva kuGPL yekutanga here, uye kuti zvikepe zvekutanga hazvifananiri zvakanyanyisa nezvazvakatorerwa here. Kuongororwa kwakaitwa nekombuta kwekufanana kwekodhi nesosi yemuenzaniso wekutanga weGPL kwakaitwa musi wa8 Gumiguru 2026, uye ongororo yenyanzvi yezvakafanana iri kuitwa. Chose chinowanikwa chakatorwa chichanyorwazve kana kugadzirwazve.",
