  "d.109szp9": "Nzvimbo dzakasimba kana zvivako zvaunogona kubvumburana nazvo.",
  "d.10azxrl": "Nhatu dzemwenje wezuva pamusoro pefotosifiya. Mumvuri ndihwo hupenyu: chivharo chenzvimbo, komete, nemiviri mikuru. Kuputika kwezuva kunouya mushure memaminitsi mashomanana.",
  "d.10wlatv": "Ruvara rwamunosarudza rune nzira yakajeka kupfuura dzose iri pasi pe0x40 runotorwa saSTOCK, saka chivharo hachizombooneki.",
  "d.11cuwtu": "MAROKETI",
  "d.11jyj1n": "Muparadzi akavakirwa pamusoro pepfuti yerelwe yemusana yepakati, ine mashongwe emalaser nenzvimbo gumi nenhanhatu dzeroketi.",
  "d.11phsqq": "Mubudisi wemitambo anobvumira zvinhu zvakagadzirwa neAI zvose 100% ndiye anobudisa mutambo.",
  "d.11zjijr": "Zvombo zvinogona kubatidzwa nekudzoserwa mukati (zvombo zvakadzoserwa mukati hazviratidzwi), uye zvikepe hazvichasiyi utsi shure.",
  "d.11zq7hg": "Maonero: makokipiti anopenya sezvazviri, nyeredzi dzakaiswa mumapoka, gasi hombe rine mhete, mudzi wenyeredzi nenebula kumashure, utsi hweinjini nemarambi ekufambisa; manzwiro ekutamba e0.1.0 akakiyiwa.",
