  "d.2vomdh": "Kuongororwa kwakaitwa nekombuta kwekufanana kwekodhi yemutambo nesosi yemuenzaniso wekutanga weGPL kwakaitwa musi wa{date0}. Ongororo yenyanzvi yezvakafanana iri kuitwa. Chose chinowanikwa chakatorwa kana kugadziridzwa chichanyorwazve.",
  "d.32ogvm": "Utsi hweinjini hunoenderana nehukuru hwemuromo, ANVIL ye240 m ine henga inoonekwa mukati nemikova, kubuda kwamaNEEDLE kumativi ose maviri, kutenderera kweATTACK pakati pechinangwa chimwe nechiri pedyo, uye maANVIL eAI anotangisa mapapiro awo.",
  "d.3b0pca": "MUONGORORI",
  "d.3bxw4p": "Kutanga kwekutsvaga mari kweveruzhinji.",
