  "d.4wz1ss": "Sikirini yeLOADOUT pamberi pemutambo wose (mutambi mumwe nenzvimbo yekusangana yevazhinji) ine matanho emuviri nechivharo, ruvara rwechivharo, mitsetse yenzvimbo dzezvombo nezvikepe zvidiki zvenzvimbo yeANVIL.",
