  "d.7xvt5u": "Zvose zvinogadziridzwa neAI paenjini yeBuB, vachishandisa Claude Code.",
  "d.87vl1g": "Kutamba pamwe panetiweki yepedyo (kuwana mitambo paWi-Fi imwe chete, kuvamba kana kupinda munzvimbo yekusangana, kutanga pamwe chete; mafungu ekubatana nowose-anorwisa-wose) nemamepu matsva matatu: LUNA, EARTH ORBIT neSOL.",
  "d.899luq": "THRESHER sezvinoratidzwa pamenyu yehenga yemutambo, muviri wevhezheni 0.6.1, maonero ezvikamu zvitatu pazvina pachitema.",
