  "economy.todayHead": "Zviripo nhasi",
  "economy.todayLead": "Matanho emuviri nechivharo neruvara rwechivharo zvesikirini yeLOADOUT (0.6.0) anoratidza rudzi rwekugadziridza nekushongedza hupfumi hwakarongerwa kupa.",
  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "Nokuti mari yawo yakarongerwa kuvabhadhara. Mutambo unotanga wakaitwa wose neAI kuti uvepo zvachose; ipapo vagadziri vanobhadharwa vanotsiva basa reAI, vachitaurwa nemazita.",
  "faq.canIPlay": "Ndinogona kutamba pamhepo here?",
  "faq.freePlay": "Unotambwa mahara here?",
  "faq.n07Questions": "07 · Mibvunzo",
  "faq.notYetLan": "Kwete parizvino. Kutamba pamwe paLAN panetiweki imwe chete kuri kushanda nhasi (kubva pa0.2.0); kutamba pamhepo hakuna kuvakwa.",
  "faq.prototypeWasBuilt": "Muenzaniso wekutanga wakavakwa paenjini yakavhurika yeQuake III Arena (GPL) ndokutorera zvikepe zveElite Dangerous senhungamiro. Pazuva rechipiri kodhi yemutambo yakatamira paBuB, injini itsva yakanyorwa naClaude Code; zvikamu zvemutambo zvakabva pamuenzaniso wekutanga zvikapiwa mazita matsva. Vhezheni 0.3.0 yakapa mhando dzose 16 dzezvikepe miviri mitsva. Ongororo yekutevedzera mitemo yerezinesi iri kutarisa kuti pane kodhi yachiri kubva kuGPL yekutanga here, uye kuti zvikepe zvekutanga hazvifananiri zvakanyanyisa nezvazvakatorerwa here. Kuongororwa kwakaitwa nekombuta kwekufanana kwekodhi nesosi yemuenzaniso wekutanga weGPL kwakaitwa musi wa<0/>, uye ongororo yenyanzvi yezvakafanana iri kuitwa. Chose chinowanikwa chakatorwa chichanyorwazve kana kugadzirwazve. Kusvikira ongororo yapera, hatitauri kuti mhinduro ndeyekuti kwete.",
  "faq.questions": "Mibvunzo",
  "faq.shipsArtInterface": "Zvikepe, mifananidzo, intafeisi nezvimwe, sekuwanikwa kwemari. <0>Bhuku riri papeji rino<\/0> rinoratidza chinhu chimwe nechimwe uye richaratidza kutsiviwa kwega kwega nemugadziri wacho.",
  "faq.shipsUpgradesPlanned": "Zvikepe nekugadziridza zvakarongerwa kuwanikwa nekutamba kana kutengwa. Maitiro anochengetwa zvakaringana nawo zvikepe zvinobhadharwa mukurwa kwemutambi nemutambi achiri kurongwa.",
  "faq.thatPlanFree": "Ndicho chirongwa: unotambwa mahara une mari yemumutambo yausingamanikidzwe uye zvekushongedza. Hazvisati zvavakwa.",
  "faq.wasAnyoneS": "Basa remumwe munhu rakakopwa here?",
  "faq.whenOutWhat": "Richabuda rinhi, uye pachii?",
  "faq.whichPartsWill": "Vanhu vachatsiva zvikamu zvipi, uye ndichazviziva sei?",
  "faq.whyWouldAi": "Mutambo wakaitwa neAI unobatsira sei vagadziri?",
  "faq.willPayWin": "Ucharipa kuti ukunde here?",
  "faq.windowsPcThere": "Windows PC. Hapana zuva rekubuda uye hapana mutengo parizvino.",
  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "Anthropic, Claude neClaude Code zviratidzo zvekutengesa zveAnthropic, PBC. Unreal Engine neEpic Games zviratidzo zvekutengesa zveEpic Games, Inc. Blender chiratidzo chekutengesa cheBlender Foundation. Quake III Arena neElite Dangerous zviratidzo zvekutengesa zvevaridzi vazvo. Mazita ose ndeevaridzi vawo uye anoshandiswa kuratidza zvinhu zvinotaurwa chete. Orion-81 haina hukama, haina kutsigirwa kana kubvumirwa nechero yavo.",
  "footer.aspirationalNoPartnership": "Chido chete. Hapana kubatana, hukama kana kubvumirwa kuripo.",
  "footer.channelComing": "Chaneli ichauya",
  "footer.devlogYoutube": "Bhuku rekuvandudza paYouTube",
  "footer.followKickstarter": "Titevedzei paKickstarter",
  "footer.futurePartners": "Vanobatana vemune ramangwana?",
  "footer.noTrackersNo": "Hapana zvishandiso zvekutevedzera. Hapana makuki. Webhusaiti yekuratidzira. Chokwadi chimwe nechimwe chinotevedzera kudura repurojekiti; hapana chiri pano chipiriso kana chivimbiso.",
  "footer.notLiveYet": "Haisati yavhurwa",
  "footer.oneItemStill": "Chinhu chimwe chichiri chakavhurika: <0>ongororo yerezinesi<\/0> yekodhi yemutambo yakabva kumuenzaniso wekutanga weGPL. Kuongororwa kwakaitwa nekombuta kwekufanana kwekodhi nesosi yemuenzaniso wekutanga kwakaitwa musi wa<1/>, uye ongororo yenyanzvi yezvakafanana iri kuitwa.",
  "footer.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 purojekiti yakagadzirwa yose neAI.<\/0> Kodhi yeOrion-81 pachayo naClaude Code, ichitungamirirwa nemuvambi; zvikepe, mamepu, mifananidzo yepamusoro nemanzwi zvakagadzirwa nezvishandiso zvakanyorwa naClaude Code. Raibhurari dzakavhurika dzinoshandiswa dzinoratidzwa pasi pe<1>'Hazvina kuitwa neAI'<\/1>.",
